{"id":"74c9df4215ffa321","group":"89","path":"89/89-fact-gl-fmp.md","title":"fact-gl-fmp — GL Has Finite Model Property","display":"fact-gl-fmp — GL Has Finite Model Property","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-fact-gl-fmp","aliases":["89-fact-gl-fmp"],"display":"fact-gl-fmp — GL Has Finite Model Property","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-finite-model-property]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-fact-gl-fmp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-fact-gl-fmp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-gl-fmp — GL Has Finite Model Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf7dbabb97c0679f\" href=\"?note=cf7dbabb97c0679f\" title=\"89-df-finite-model-property\">89-df-finite-model-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\\)</span> is the GL-frame predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}fmp}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists W,R\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}fmp}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists W,R\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li>FMP : 有限模型性质 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cf7dbabb97c0679f\" href=\"?note=cf7dbabb97c0679f\" title=\"89-df-finite-model-property\">89-df-finite-model-property</a>)</li>\n<li>GL具有有限模型性质</li>\n<li>可判定性的关键基础</li>\n<li>结论给出的是框架反例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R)\\not\\models A\">\\((W,R)\\not\\models A\\)</span> 已经量化了该框架上的\n所有赋值，并断言至少一个赋值与世界反驳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite-model-property","status":"resolved","id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-model-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite-model-property","status":"resolved","id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"FMP : 有限模型性质 (see [[89-df-finite-model-property]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}gl\\text{-}fmp}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists W,R\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\n\\land\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\n\\land(W,R)\\not\\models A\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"(W,R)\\not\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1128,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","cf7dbabb97c0679f","c6ab46cd662b1409","dbba58e7bd3b0667","9cd755e57aea2c47"]}